    {
      "title": "Module 3: Ordering Food",
      "subtopics": [
        {
          "title": "3.1 Ordering and Making Requests",
          "lessons": [
            {
              "title": "How to Order Politely",
              "weight": 4,
              "content": [
                {
                  "order": 1,
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "{\"time\":1700000404000,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"bC6dE7fG8h\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"In English, it is important to sound polite when ordering food. Here are the best phrases:\"}},{\"id\":\"iJ9kL0mN1o\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"<b>Getting attention:</b><br><em>Excuse me! / Could we order, please? / We're ready to order.</em>\"}},{\"id\":\"pQ2rS3tU4v\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"<b>Ordering:</b><br><em>I'd like the grilled salmon, please.</em><br><em>I'll have the tomato soup as a starter.</em><br><em>Could I have the steak, please?</em>\"}},{\"id\":\"wX5yZ6aB7c\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"<b>Asking questions about the menu:</b><br><em>What's in the pasta? / Is the soup vegetarian? / Does this dish contain nuts?</em>\"}},{\"id\":\"dE8fG9hI0j\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"<b>Making special requests:</b><br><em>Could I have it without the sauce? / Can I substitute chips for salad? / I'd like my steak well-done, please.</em>\"}},{\"id\":\"kL1mN2oP3q\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"<b>Steak doneness:</b> rare → medium-rare → medium → medium-well → well-done\"}}],\"version\":\"2.31.4\"}"
                },
                {
                  "order": 2,
                  "type": "speech-recognition",
                  "content": {
                    "instructions": "Practise ordering politely",
                    "targetPhrase": "I'd like the grilled salmon, please. Could I have it without the sauce?"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "order": 3,
