            {
              "title": "Full Restaurant Dialogue",
              "weight": 5,
              "content": [
                {
                  "order": 1,
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "{\"time\":1700000405000,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"rS4tU5vW6x\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"Read this complete restaurant dialogue carefully:\"}},{\"id\":\"yZ7aB8cD9e\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"<b>Waiter:</b> Good evening! Do you have a reservation?<br><b>Customer:</b> Yes, we do. The name is Smith. A table for two.<br><b>Waiter:</b> Perfect, right this way. Here are your menus. Can I get you something to drink?<br><b>Customer:</b> I'd like a glass of still water and a glass of red wine, please.<br><b>Waiter:</b> Of course. Are you ready to order?<br><b>Customer:</b> Almost. What is the daily special today?<br><b>Waiter:</b> It's roasted duck with vegetables and mashed potato.<br><b>Customer:</b> That sounds lovely! I'll have the daily special, please.<br><b>Waiter:</b> Excellent choice. And anything else?<br><b>Customer:</b> Could we see the dessert menu later, please?<br><b>Waiter:</b> Absolutely! I'll be back shortly.\"}},{\"id\":\"fG0hI1jK2l\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"<b>Key expressions:</b> <em>Do you have a reservation? / A table for two. / That sounds lovely. / Excellent choice.</em>\"}}],\"version\":\"2.31.4\"}"
                },
                {
                  "order": 2,
                  "type": "video",
                  "url": "VIDEO_PLACEHOLDER"
                },
                {
                  "order": 3,
                  "type": "speech-recognition",
                  "content": {
                    "instructions": "Practise the customer's dialogue lines",
                    "targetPhrase": "That sounds lovely! I'll have the daily special, please."
                  }
                },
